                        I am eager to hone my skills and contribute to innovative projects that make a difference. 
                        Born and raised in New York City, I developed a passion for technology that led me to 
                        St. John's University, where I recently graduated with my <strong>Bachelor's degree in Computer Science</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Outside of work and academics, I enjoy travelling, reading an interesting book, 
